{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09969","headline":"江南遇雨 · 张鼎","name":"江南遇雨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江天寒意少，冬月雨仍飞。\n出户愁爲听，从风洒客衣。\n旅魂惊处断，乡信意中微。\n几日应晴去，孤舟且欲归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张鼎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09969.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09969","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}